    {
      "id": "YL5fzJqYOrilK4YS9z4iU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2629.8278685936725,
      "y": 2416.6708142543766,
      "width": 650.9595947265625,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4b",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1403449775,
      "version": 1104,
      "versionNonce": 1472406433,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779964206107,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " - Auth:\n    /api/v1/auth/login/ [GET]\n    /api/v1/auth/me/ [GET]\n\n - Delivery\n    /api/v1/delivery/ [POST]\n    /api/v1/deliveries/ [GET]\n    /api/v1/delivery/<str:tracking_id>/ [GET] [PATCH] [DELETE]\n\n- Courier\n    /api/v1/courier/ [POST]\n    /api/v1/couriers/ [GET]\n    /api/v1/courier/<str:courier_cf>/ [GET] [PATCH] [DELETE]\n\n- Locations\n    /api/v1/provinces/ [GET]\n    /api/v1/cities/<int:province_id>/ [GET]\n\n- State\n    /api/v1/next_states/<int:state_id>/\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " - Auth:\n    /api/v1/auth/login/ [GET]\n    /api/v1/auth/me/ [GET]\n\n - Delivery\n    /api/v1/delivery/ [POST]\n    /api/v1/deliveries/ [GET]\n    /api/v1/delivery/<str:tracking_id>/ [GET] [PATCH] [DELETE]\n\n- Courier\n    /api/v1/courier/ [POST]\n    /api/v1/couriers/ [GET]\n    /api/v1/courier/<str:courier_cf>/ [GET] [PATCH] [DELETE]\n\n- Locations\n    /api/v1/provinces/ [GET]\n    /api/v1/cities/<int:province_id>/ [GET]\n\n- State\n    /api/v1/next_states/<int:state_id>/\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dUVbDU9TBI1FSYL-NaPg2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2637.042955671061,
      "y": 2933.000783178206,
      "width": 954.316650390625,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4f",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 93377825,
      "version": 1807,
      "versionNonce": 725616769,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780074517225,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Based on the current state_id, the front-end will ask for the next possible states\nof a package: for example, a package can't be damaged before it's even prepared\nor the package can't be delivered if it's still in preparation.\n\nBest case scenario:\n    Ordered -> In preparation -> Delivering -> Arriving (at address)\n\nOther possible scenarios:\n    - Ordered -> [In preparation]\n    - In preparation -> [Damaged, Lost, Delivering]\n    - Damaged -> [Refounded, Ordered]\n    - Lost -> [Refounded, Ordered, Found]\n    - Found -> [Delivering, Arriving at address]\n    - Delivering -> [Damaged, Lost, Arriving]\n    - Arriving -> [Delivered]\n    - Refounded (Delivery will automatically close)\n    - Delivered (Delivery will automatically close)\n\n* Important notes\n- Closed deliveries can be reopen and edited\n- It's possible to change state history so if there's a mistake, staff will be able\nto correct it, history will be displayed as a table, single states can be edited but it must respect\ncertain conditions in order to be changed\n\nOrdered state will always be unremovable\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Based on the current state_id, the front-end will ask for the next possible states\nof a package: for example, a package can't be damaged before it's even prepared\nor the package can't be delivered if it's still in preparation.\n\nBest case scenario:\n    Ordered -> In preparation -> Delivering -> Arriving (at address)\n\nOther possible scenarios:\n    - Ordered -> [In preparation]\n    - In preparation -> [Damaged, Lost, Delivering]\n    - Damaged -> [Refounded, Ordered]\n    - Lost -> [Refounded, Ordered, Found]\n    - Found -> [Delivering, Arriving at address]\n    - Delivering -> [Damaged, Lost, Arriving]\n    - Arriving -> [Delivered]\n    - Refounded (Delivery will automatically close)\n    - Delivered (Delivery will automatically close)\n\n* Important notes\n- Closed deliveries can be reopen and edited\n- It's possible to change state history so if there's a mistake, staff will be able\nto correct it, history will be displayed as a table, single states can be edited but it must respect\ncertain conditions in order to be changed\n\nOrdered state will always be unremovable\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
